{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07469","headline":"狱中闻收东京有赦 · 刘长卿","name":"狱中闻收东京有赦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"传闻阙下降丝纶，爲报关东灭虏尘。\n壮志已怜成白首，余生犹待发青春。\n风霜何事偏伤物，天地无情亦爱人。\n持法不须张密网，恩波自解惜枯鳞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}